WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.179 --> 00:00:04.012
- What's up Believe Nation,

00:00:04.012 --> 00:00:08.179
I want to give away some
free stuff every single day

00:00:09.459 --> 00:00:11.978
to you guys while quantities last,

00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:14.996
and I'm excited to announce what
we're going to be giving away.

00:00:14.996 --> 00:00:16.653
So, the reason why I'm doing this,

00:00:16.653 --> 00:00:18.195
I made a video not too long ago,

00:00:18.195 --> 00:00:20.797
YouTube really values views and engagement

00:00:20.797 --> 00:00:22.782
in the first 24 hours,

00:00:22.782 --> 00:00:24.355
especially if you got new videos up.

00:00:24.355 --> 00:00:25.808
It's called view velocity.

00:00:25.808 --> 00:00:27.551
- Within the first 48 hours,

00:00:27.551 --> 00:00:29.273
YouTube really makes a determination

00:00:29.273 --> 00:00:32.277
as to whether this video is
going to be served very broadly

00:00:32.277 --> 00:00:34.077
or whether it's going
to just kind of go back

00:00:34.077 --> 00:00:36.256
to the video corpus where it'll receive

00:00:36.256 --> 00:00:39.705
very few views over its lifetime.

00:00:39.705 --> 00:00:43.641
- [Interviewer] Okay, so if I
want to sort of play the system

00:00:43.641 --> 00:00:45.325
what should I do?

00:00:45.325 --> 00:00:47.808
- You should focus on getting views

00:00:47.808 --> 00:00:49.415
very early in a video's lifespan,

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:51.776
this means featuring the video
across your social media,

00:00:51.776 --> 00:00:54.804
sending it out on an email
blast as soon as possible,

00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:56.138
the sort of thing that can drive

00:00:56.138 --> 00:00:58.299
a lot of view velocity very early.

00:00:58.299 --> 00:01:01.389
- So, the more you get views on a video

00:01:01.389 --> 00:01:03.990
soon after it comes out
to your subscribers,

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:06.157
the more likely YouTube...

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:08.856
He was making noises with the dog toy.

00:01:08.856 --> 00:01:11.058
The more likely YouTube
is going to promote

00:01:11.058 --> 00:01:12.695
those videos across their network.

00:01:12.695 --> 00:01:15.352
And so I wanted to figure
out a way to get you guys

00:01:15.352 --> 00:01:16.548
to watch more of the videos,

00:01:16.548 --> 00:01:19.562
but also reward you for
doing so and being engaged,

00:01:19.562 --> 00:01:23.838
and more importantly,
watching the videos quickly,

00:01:23.838 --> 00:01:25.496
and not waiting a week or month

00:01:25.496 --> 00:01:27.407
because that negatively impacts

00:01:27.407 --> 00:01:28.900
my videos and my channel.

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:29.739
You want to see Teemo?

00:01:29.739 --> 00:01:31.248
Want to say hi to Teemo?

00:01:31.248 --> 00:01:33.131
Come say hi, Teemo.

00:01:33.131 --> 00:01:34.127
This is Teemo.

00:01:34.127 --> 00:01:35.711
He's getting his adult teeth in.

00:01:35.711 --> 00:01:37.343
You excited to be on camera, mister?

00:01:37.343 --> 00:01:38.618
You excited to be on camera?

00:01:38.618 --> 00:01:39.707
This is his new toy that Nina bought.

00:01:39.707 --> 00:01:41.631
(toy squeaking)

00:01:41.631 --> 00:01:43.207
So if you hear that, that's
where it's coming from.

00:01:43.207 --> 00:01:44.755
See, look how excited he gets.

00:01:44.755 --> 00:01:46.743
(toy squeaking)

00:01:46.743 --> 00:01:48.298
You want that, huh?

00:01:48.298 --> 00:01:49.704
Okay, good boy.

00:01:49.704 --> 00:01:50.704
Alright, so,

00:01:51.999 --> 00:01:53.135
